1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,200
Khawateen-o-hazraat, waqt hua hai raat ke das bajay ka.

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:09,600
Mulk bhar mein polling ka waqt khatam aur ginti ka aaghaz ho chuka hai.

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:16,200
Jee bilkul Tariq, tamaam halqon se ballot boxes seal kar ke ginti ka amal baqaida shuru kiya ja chuka hai.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:21,500
Election Commission ke mutabiq subah theek chhay bajay hatmi nataij ka ailaan kiya jayega.

5
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:26,600
Subah chhay bajay tak nataij ki pal pal surat-e-haal ke liye hamaray saath rahiye.
